# AI SEO (AEO / GEO / LLMO)

**Intent:** Get **cited** in AI-generated answers — not just ranked. Skip for traditional technical audits (`on-page-seo.mdc`) or backlink campaigns (`off-page-seo.mdc`).

## Goal shift

Traditional SEO → rank on page 1. AI SEO → be selected as a **source** in Google AI Overviews, ChatGPT, Perplexity, Claude, Copilot. A well-structured page can be cited even outside top organic positions.

## Google vs other engines

| Engine | Optimize for |
|--------|----------------|
| **Google AI Overviews** | People-first content, core Search quality, E-E-A-T — **no separate "AI-only" pages** (scaled content abuse risk) |
| **ChatGPT, Perplexity, Claude, Copilot** | Extractable structure + optional machine-readable files (`llms.txt`, `/pricing.md`) |

Default: **write for people, organize for clarity** — satisfies both.

## Three pillars

1. **Structure** — make content extractable (see patterns below).
2. **Authority** — stats with sources (+37–40% citation lift), expert quotes with name/title, freshness dates.
3. **Presence** — Wikipedia accuracy, Reddit/forums, G2/Capterra, YouTube, industry roundups (brands are often cited via third parties).

## Content patterns

- **40–60 word answer** directly under each query-matched H2/H3.
- Block types: definition, numbered steps, comparison **table**, FAQ Q&A, stat-with-source.
- Cover **topical clusters** (5–10 related questions) — Google AI fans out to related queries.
- Semantic HTML: `<article>`, `<section>`, proper heading hierarchy, `alt` on images.
- Tables beat prose for "X vs Y"; numbered lists beat paragraphs for "how to."

## Machine-readable (optional, non-Google)

- `/llms.txt` — product summary + links to key pages ([llmstxt.org](https://llmstxt.org))
- `/pricing.md` — plain-text tiers, limits, prices (parseable by AI shopping agents)

## AI crawler access

Audit `robots.txt` — blocking = no citation on that platform:

| Bot | Platform |
|-----|----------|
| GPTBot, ChatGPT-User | OpenAI |
| PerplexityBot | Perplexity |
| ClaudeBot, anthropic-ai | Anthropic |
| Google-Extended | Gemini / AI Overviews training opt-out |
| Bingbot | Copilot |

## Anti-patterns

- Keyword stuffing (hurts AI visibility ~10%)
- Thin scaled AI-only duplicate pages
- Blocking all AI bots then expecting citations

## DIY visibility audit

Test 10–20 priority queries across platforms. Output table:

| Query | Google AI Overview | ChatGPT | Perplexity | You cited? | Competitors cited |

Plus **extractability checklist** per URL: definition in para 1, self-contained answer blocks, FAQ schema, stats sourced, last-updated date.

## Your routine

- **Monthly:** Re-run visibility matrix on top 10 queries; fix pages with Fail on extractability.
- **Quarterly:** Refresh statistics, FAQ blocks, comparison tables.

## Free tools

Manual query tests, Rich Results Test, GSC, robots.txt review.

